OL,3,GNEWSAFormer DUP leader Jeffrey
OL,4,ADonaldson being sentenced for child sex
OL,5,Aabuse
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe former leader of the Democratic
OL,8,FUnionist Party (DUP), Jeffrey
OL,9,FDonaldson, is being sentenced for a
OL,10,Fseries of child sex offences, including
OL,11,Frape
OL,13,FDonaldson was convicted in June of 18
OL,14,Fcounts of sex abuse, which he committed
OL,15,Fagainst two women when they were
OL,16,Fchildren. The offences occurred between
OL,17,F1985 and 2008
OL,19,FIn July, the 63-year-old - who was an
OL,20,FMP for 27 years, until 2024 - was
OL,21,Fstripped of his knighthood by the King
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
