OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFormer DUP leader Jeffrey
OL,4,ADonaldson being sentenced for child sex
OL,5,Aabuse
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonaldson arrived at court this morning
OL,8,Ffrom Maghaberry Prison. Opening the
OL,9,Fsentencing, the judge calls it a
OL,10,F"disturbing and disquieting" case
OL,12,FDonaldson's wife, Eleanor, faced a
OL,13,F"trial of the facts" on mental health
OL,14,Fgrounds, relating to five charges,
OL,15,Fincluding four related to aiding and
OL,16,Fabetting
OL,18,FShe was found to have "done the acts",
OL,19,Fand will hear about any actions taken
OL,20,Fagainst her at a later date
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
